      ],
      "content": "SP 8608, SP 8607 9/197, 10/197 21.12.67 WENDOVER AYLESBURY ROAD east side No.26 (formerly listed as two cottages next but one N. of the Red House). GV II Small house. C18, painted brick, old tile roof, brick chimney in centre behind ridge, and small chimney on RH end. 2-storeys. 2 bays of 4 pane wide sash windows in reveals to 1st floor, 1 similar window with segmental arch to ground floor with door to LH and carriage door to RH, both with segmental arches. Listing NGR: SP8693007994"
